#
# Purpose: Keep local-only workspace, editor, build, and scratch artifacts out of commits.
# Caller: Git status, add, and review workflows for this repository.
# Dependencies: Git ignore pattern matching and repository-local scratch conventions.
# Main Functions: Ignore generated outputs, local settings, logs, and planning scratch files.
# Side Effects: Hides matching untracked local files from normal Git status and add flows.
#
# Local workspace settings
.keel/*
# Ignore everything inside .claude/ by default, then track plugin-shipped
# subagents and hook config. (settings.local.json and similar stay local.)
/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/
!/.claude/hooks.json
# Secrets and credentials (defense-in-depth)
.env*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Editor folders
.idea/
.vscode/

# Native build artifacts
bin/
dist/
coverage.out
*.test
/keel-bin
/keel-bin.exe

# Dependency install trees and binary lockfiles (any clone, any host)
node_modules/
bun.lockb

# Rust build artifacts
/target/
# Scratch build/test dir used for isolated verification runs (cargo output + logs).
/target-test/
# Local state cache directory generated during tests or runs
state/
**/state/
# Generated code-graph artifacts (keel code-graph build output).
/.understand/
.understand/
# Cargo.lock is committed for reproducible binary builds per Cargo convention.

# Local assistant settings
.*/settings.local.json

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

*.log
# Audit raw command-output subtrees (evidence logs, not source); already-tracked
# historical logs stay tracked, but new audit runs will not stage new ones.
docs/audits/**/raw/
# Temp, patch, and log files
/.claude_tmp*
/.gh-*.log
*.log
*.tmp
*-cover.out
/$cover
*.bak
*.swp
*.orig
*.rej

# Local planning scratch files
/KEEL-10-10-IMPROVEMENT-PLAN.md
/KEEL-JEV-INSPIRED-IMPROVEMENT-PLAN.md
plan.md
todo.md
todo.local.md
.scratch/

# Local session / agent continuation scratch (never ship)
.omo/
**/tmp-keel-*.txt
**/* - Copy/

# Local validation and flow artifacts
VALIDATION_REPORT.md
flow-check.json
verify_*.ps1

# Third-party comparison directories
karpathy-skills-cmp/
split.py

# Research clones (do not ship)
/hermes-agent/
